  "Pull the card's background gradient from the achievement icon's own colors instead of the fixed colors below. Works on every template except Paper Light. Falls back to the fixed colors if the icon has no clear dominant colors (or no icon is available).": "Pega o gradiente de fundo do cart\u00e3o das cores do \u00edcone da conquista em vez das cores fixas abaixo. Funciona em todos os modelos, exceto Paper Light. Volta \u00e0s cores fixas se o \u00edcone n\u00e3o tiver cores dominantes claras (ou se n\u00e3o houver \u00edcone).",
  "Pull the gradient from the game's own artwork instead, so every toast in a game shares one palette. Turning this on turns off the icon option above (they're one or the other). Falls back to the icon's colors if the artwork can't be read.": "Pega o gradiente da arte do pr\u00f3prio jogo, de modo que todas as notifica\u00e7\u00f5es de um jogo compartilhem uma paleta. Ativar isto desativa a op\u00e7\u00e3o de \u00edcone acima (\u00e9 uma ou a outra). Volta \u00e0s cores do \u00edcone se a arte n\u00e3o puder ser lida.",
