  "Extra touches on some templates: typing text, animated backgrounds, glitches, screws, a game-name header and more. Turn off for the plain look.": "Baz\u0131 \u015fablonlarda ekstralar: yaz\u0131lan metin, hareketli arka planlar, aksakl\u0131k efektleri, vidalar, oyun ad\u0131 ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve daha fazlas\u0131. Sade g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcm i\u00e7in kapat\u0131n.",
  "Font size of the achievement name.": "Ba\u015far\u0131m ad\u0131n\u0131n yaz\u0131 boyutu.",
  "Font size of the small eyebrow label above the title.": "Ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n \u00fcst\u00fcndeki k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck etiketin yaz\u0131 boyutu.",
  "Font size of the subtitle/description line.": "Alt ba\u015fl\u0131k/a\u00e7\u0131klama sat\u0131r\u0131n\u0131n yaz\u0131 boyutu.",
