  "Gradient direction": "Gradyan y\u00f6n\u00fc",
  "Gradient from game artwork colors": "Gradyan\u0131 oyun g\u00f6rseli renklerinden al",
  "Gradient from icon colors": "Gradyan\u0131 simge renklerinden al",
  "History & sharing": "Ge\u00e7mi\u015f ve payla\u015f\u0131m",
  "How far the glow rings spread. 50 is the default look; 0 hides them, 100 doubles it.": "Par\u0131lt\u0131 halkalar\u0131n\u0131n ne kadar yay\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131. 50 varsay\u0131lan g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcmd\u00fcr; 0 onlar\u0131 gizler, 100 iki kat\u0131na \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131r.",
  "How long the toast stays on screen before it slides away.": "Bildirimin kay\u0131p gitmeden \u00f6nce ekranda kalma s\u00fcresi.",
  "Icon frame ring": "Simge \u00e7er\u00e7eve halkas\u0131",
  "Icon glow": "Simge par\u0131lt\u0131s\u0131",
  "If you hear the sound but no popup appears (for example on a different handheld), run this check. It tests the Python packages, graphics libraries, display and window creation the popup needs, and tells you what's missing.": "Sesi duyuyor ama bildirim g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa (\u00f6rne\u011fin farkl\u0131 bir el konsolunda) bu kontrol\u00fc \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n. Bildirimin ihtiya\u00e7 duydu\u011fu Python paketlerini, grafik kitapl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131, ekran\u0131 ve pencere olu\u015fturmay\u0131 s\u0131nar ve nelerin eksik oldu\u011funu s\u00f6yler.",
  "In progress": "Devam ediyor",
  "Key saved (ending in {tail})": "Anahtar kaydedildi ({tail} ile biten)",
