  "Names each unlock by how few players have it (Uncommon, Rare, Ultra rare) in the popup label. Ultra rare also gets extra sparkles and a longer shine. Rare keeps the gold look and sound.": "Her a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131\u015f\u0131, ka\u00e7 oyuncuda oldu\u011funa g\u00f6re (Az rastlanan, Nadir, \u00c7ok nadir) bildirim etiketinde adland\u0131r\u0131r. \u00c7ok nadir ayr\u0131ca ekstra par\u0131lt\u0131 ve daha uzun bir \u0131\u015f\u0131lt\u0131 al\u0131r. Nadir, alt\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcm\u00fc ve sesi korur.",
  "Needs Rarity Tiers on; otherwise common sounds play.": "Nadirlik Kademeleri a\u00e7\u0131k olmal\u0131; aksi halde yayg\u0131n sesler \u00e7alar.",
  "Needs Rarity Tiers on; otherwise the rare sound plays.": "Nadirlik Kademeleri a\u00e7\u0131k olmal\u0131; aksi halde nadir ses \u00e7alar.",
  "New achievement": "Yeni ba\u015far\u0131m",
  "No API key set -- using the local cache only (can't guarantee the colored icon).": "API anahtar\u0131 ayarlanmad\u0131 -- yaln\u0131zca yerel \u00f6nbellek kullan\u0131l\u0131yor (renkli simge garanti edilemez).",
  "No API key set -- using the local cache only.": "API anahtar\u0131 ayarlanmad\u0131 -- yaln\u0131zca yerel \u00f6nbellek kullan\u0131l\u0131yor.",
  "No Chinese font was found, so Chinese popup text may show as empty boxes. Copy a font file (.ttf, .otf or .ttc, for example Noto Sans SC) into {folder} and run a test popup.": "\u00c7ince yaz\u0131 tipi bulunamad\u0131, bu y\u00fczden \u00c7ince bildirim metni bo\u015f kutular olarak g\u00f6r\u00fcnebilir. Bir yaz\u0131 tipi dosyas\u0131n\u0131 (.ttf, .otf veya .ttc, \u00f6rne\u011fin Noto Sans SC) {folder} klas\u00f6r\u00fcne kopyalay\u0131n ve bir test bildirimi \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.",
  "No achievements found for this game.": "Bu oyun i\u00e7in ba\u015far\u0131m bulunamad\u0131.",
  "No achievements match your search.": "Araman\u0131zla e\u015fle\u015fen ba\u015far\u0131m yok.",
