  "No game running": "\u00c7al\u0131\u015fan oyun yok",
  "No unlocks recorded yet. Achievements you unlock from now on will appear here.": "Hen\u00fcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131\u015f yok. Bundan sonra a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z ba\u015far\u0131mlar burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.",
  "Nothing pinned right now.": "\u015eu an sabitlenmi\u015f bir \u015fey yok.",
