  "Popup template": "Bildirim \u015fablonu",
  "Pull the card's background gradient from the achievement icon's own colors instead of the fixed colors below. Works on every template except Paper Light. Falls back to the fixed colors if the icon has no clear dominant colors (or no icon is available).": "Kart\u0131n arka plan gradyan\u0131n\u0131, a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki sabit renkler yerine ba\u015far\u0131m simgesinin kendi renklerinden al\u0131r. Paper Light d\u0131\u015f\u0131ndaki her \u015fablonda \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Simgede belirgin bask\u0131n renk yoksa (veya simge yoksa) sabit renklere d\u00f6ner.",
  "Pull the gradient from the game's own artwork instead, so every toast in a game shares one palette. Turning this on turns off the icon option above (they're one or the other). Falls back to the icon's colors if the artwork can't be read.": "Gradyan\u0131 bunun yerine oyunun kendi g\u00f6rselinden al\u0131r; b\u00f6ylece bir oyundaki t\u00fcm bildirimler tek bir palet payla\u015f\u0131r. Bunu a\u00e7mak yukar\u0131daki simge se\u00e7ene\u011fini kapat\u0131r (ikisinden biri ge\u00e7erlidir). G\u00f6rsel okunamazsa simgenin renklerine d\u00f6ner.",
