  "Used the guaranteed-correct colored icon from Steam's Web API (case-insensitive match).": "Steam'in Web API'sinden do\u011frulu\u011fu garantili renkli simge kullan\u0131ld\u0131 (b\u00fcy\u00fck/k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck harf duyars\u0131z e\u015fle\u015fme).",
