  "Watcher Status": "\u0130zleyici Durumu",
  "When on, every setting below applies only to this game and is saved for next time. It starts as a copy of your current settings. Turning it off keeps what you saved.": "A\u00e7\u0131kken, a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki t\u00fcm ayarlar yaln\u0131zca bu oyun i\u00e7in ge\u00e7erlidir ve bir sonraki sefer i\u00e7in kaydedilir. Mevcut ayarlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n bir kopyas\u0131yla ba\u015flar. Kapatmak, kaydettiklerinizi korur.",
  "When you close a game, shows how many achievements you unlocked while playing, for example 3 unlocked, 1 rare.": "Bir oyunu kapatt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131zda, oynarken ka\u00e7 ba\u015far\u0131m a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 g\u00f6sterir; \u00f6rne\u011fin 3 a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131, 1 nadir.",
  "When you unlock the very last achievement in any game, shows a special emerald completion popup after that achievement's own popup.": "Herhangi bir oyundaki son ba\u015far\u0131m\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131zda, o ba\u015far\u0131m\u0131n kendi bildiriminden sonra \u00f6zel bir z\u00fcmr\u00fct rengi tamamlama bildirimi g\u00f6sterir.",
  "Where the banner appears on screen.": "Banner\u0131n ekranda g\u00f6r\u00fcnd\u00fc\u011f\u00fc yer.",
  "Which popup template the tracker is drawn with. Try Game Art Blur to put the game's artwork behind it.": "Takip\u00e7inin hangi bildirim \u015fablonuyla \u00e7izilece\u011fi. Oyunun g\u00f6rselini arkas\u0131na koymak i\u00e7in Game Art Blur'u deneyin.",
  "While a game is running, tests show a random achievement from it (even a locked one) with its real icon and the game's artwork. Tests never count as unlocks. With no game running, or this off, tests use a sample.": "Bir oyun \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken testler, ondan rastgele bir ba\u015far\u0131m\u0131 (kilitli olan dahil) ger\u00e7ek simgesi ve oyunun g\u00f6rseliyle g\u00f6sterir. Testler asla a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131\u015f say\u0131lmaz. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan oyun yoksa veya bu kapal\u0131ysa testler bir \u00f6rnek kullan\u0131r.",
  "Your own sounds: put .wav, .flac, .ogg or .mp3 files (10 MB or less, kept short) in {folder}, then press Refresh. They show up with \"(yours)\" after their name, and updating the plugin never deletes them. Use the test buttons below to hear each one.": "Kendi seslerinizi ekleyin: .wav, .flac, .ogg veya .mp3 dosyalar\u0131n\u0131 (10 MB veya daha k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck, k\u0131sa tutun) {folder} klas\u00f6r\u00fcne koyup Yenile'ye bas\u0131n. Adlar\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131nda \"(sizin)\" ile g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcrler ve eklentiyi g\u00fcncellemek onlar\u0131 asla silmez. Her birini duymak i\u00e7in a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki test d\u00fc\u011fmelerini kullan\u0131n.",
